"""Rebuild the offline guess dictionary; run by hand, never at page load.

Source: dwyl/english-words, Unlicense. Only five-letter ASCII entries are
kept. The answer list is our own small selection of familiar words, not the
official Wordle answer list. Keep its order stable: daily words depend on it.
"""
